## 2) User Roles

| Role (EN / AZ) | Who | Can do | Cannot do |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Admin / Administrator** | HR system owner | Everything. Assign roles and departments to users, load sample data, delete records, export all reports | — |
| **HR Evaluator / HR qiymətləndirici** | HR team | View and edit all positions, score section 12, approve or return a position, export all reports | Manage users, delete records |
| **Department Manager / Departament meneceri** | Head of a department | Create and edit positions **in their own department only** (sections 1–11), submit them for evaluation, view section 12 read-only, export their department's reports | Edit section 12, approve, see other departments |
| **Pending / Gözləmədə** | Anyone after their first Google sign-in | Sees a "waiting for role" screen | Everything else |

### Workflow (status)

```
Draft ──(Manager submits)──► Submitted ──(HR opens & scores)──► Under evaluation
  ▲                                                                  │
  └──────────────(HR returns with comment)── Returned ◄──────────────┤
                                                                     └──(HR approves)──► Approved
```

| Status key | EN | AZ | Badge colour |
|---|---|---|---|
| `draft` | Draft | Qaralama | Grey |
| `submitted` | Submitted | Göndərilib | Blue #14376F |
| `under_evaluation` | Under evaluation | Qiymətləndirilir | Teal #1A596A |
| `returned` | Returned | Qaytarılıb | Amber |
| `approved` | Approved | Təsdiqlənib | Green |

- A Manager can edit only when the status is `draft` or `returned`.
- A Manager can set the status only to `draft` or `submitted`.
- HR and Admin can edit at any status. Once a position is `approved`, the app asks "Edit an approved position?" before allowing changes.

