**Calculation**: `totalScore` = the sum of the 9 scores. All factors have equal weight, so the total runs from 9 to 45. The total maps to a grade like this:

| Total | Grade |
|---|---|
| 9–12 | G1 |
| 13–16 | G2 |
| 17–20 | G3 |
| 21–24 | G4 |
| 25–28 | G5 |
| 29–32 | G6 |
| 33–36 | G7 |
| 37–39 | G8 |
| 40–42 | G9 |
| 43–45 | G10 |

```js
export function recommendGrade(total) {
  const bands = [[12,"G1"],[16,"G2"],[20,"G3"],[24,"G4"],[28,"G5"],
                 [32,"G6"],[36,"G7"],[39,"G8"],[42,"G9"],[45,"G10"]];
  return (bands.find(([max]) => total <= max) || [null, null])[1];
}
// Returns null until all 9 scores are present.
```

