### 5G) Excel reports (`js/export.js`, SheetJS)

General rules:
- Column headers are in the current UI language.
- Dates are written as YYYY-MM-DD and option keys are turned into labels.
- Yes/No is written as Yes/No or Bəli/Xeyr.
- The header row is frozen (`!freeze`) and column widths are set automatically (`!cols`).

