| **B. Full Job Profiles** | `job-profiles-YYYY-MM-DD.xlsx` | Sheet "Positions": one row per position with all fields of sections 1, 2 and 4–11, flattened. Sheet "Responsibilities": one row per responsibility (Position ID, Employee Code, + 7 fields). Sheet "Evaluations": section 12 fields |
| **C. Single position** | `{positionId}-{fullName}.xlsx` | Sheet "Job Description": 3 columns (Section, Field, Value) covering all sections. Sheet "Responsibilities": the 7 fields per responsibility |

