- Max content width 1200px, centred, 24px page padding (16px on mobile).
- Breakpoints: ≥1024 desktop · 768–1023 tablet · <768 mobile.
- Card grid: `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr))`, gap 16px.
