- Section labels: 12px, uppercase, letter-spacing .08em, colour `--accent`.
- Headings: H1 28px / H2 20px / body 15px / small 13px.
- Visible focus ring on everything. Colour contrast meets WCAG AA.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. Transitions are short (150ms).

